SUMMARY:🚀 [LAUNCH J-1] migration-autopilot — Warmup 2h (stars + article + 
 tweet + LinkedIn FR + newsletters)
DESCRIPTION:BLOC 2H — clique chaque lien.\n\n━━━ 1) ⭐ STARS (20 min) ━━━\nE
 nvoie ce message à 5 amis dev (WhatsApp) :\n« Hey [prénom]\, j'ai publié mi
 gration-autopilot. ⭐ stp ? https://github.com/isabellehuecloser-ctrl/migrat
 ion-autopilot »\n\nCompteur stars : https://github.com/isabellehuecloser-ct
 rl/migration-autopilot\n\n━━━ 2) 📝 ARTICLE Dev.to (10 min) ━━━\na) Ouvrir 
 le gist public (article inside) : https://gist.github.com/isabellehuecloser
 -ctrl/1903028c2bc942db128e6f0ab085ce82\nb) Bouton 'Raw' → Ctrl+A → Ctrl+C\n
 c) Ouvrir https://dev.to/new → coller → Publish\n⚠️ GARDE L'URL publiée (be
 soin pour Reddit mercredi).\n\n━━━ 3) 🐦 TWEET THREAD (10 min) ━━━\nTweet #
 1 (prérempli\, juste Post) :\nhttps://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=A%20mig
 ration%20that%20ran%20in%200.4%20seconds%20on%20staging%20locked%20our%20pr
 od%20users%20table%20for%2020%20minutes.%0A%0AThree%20tokens%20of%20SQL.%20
 %60ALTER%20COLUMN%20...%20SET%20NOT%20NULL%60%20on%20a%20billion-row%20tabl
 e.%0A%0ASo%20I%20built%20the%20linter%20I%20wanted%3A%20it%20reads%20every%
 20PR%20and%20blocks%20the%20unsafe%20migrations%20before%20merge.\n\nPuis r
 éponds avec #2 → #5 du fichier week-of-2026-06-08.md.\n\n━━━ 4) 💼 LINKEDIN
  FR (10 min) ━━━\nPost FR prérempli\, juste Publier :\nhttps://www.linkedin
 .com/feed/?shareActive=true&text=Une%20migration%20qui%20a%20tourn%C3%A9%20
 en%200%2C4%20seconde%20sur%20staging%20a%20lock%C3%A9%20notre%20table%20use
 rs%20en%20prod%20pendant%2020%20minutes.%0A%0ALa%20ligne%2C%20c'%C3%A9taien
 t%20trois%20tokens.%20ALTER%20COLUMN%20...%20SET%20NOT%20NULL.%20Staging%20
 avait%2030%20000%20lignes.%20La%20prod%20en%20avait%20plus%20d'un%20milliar
 d.%20Postgres%20a%20scann%C3%A9%20chaque%20ligne%20pour%20valider%20la%20co
 ntrainte%2C%20en%20tenant%20un%20lock%20exclusif%20tout%20du%20long.%20Pend
 ant%2020%20minutes%2C%20l'app%20a%20renvoy%C3%A9%20des%20503%20%C3%A0%20tou
 t%20le%20monde.%0A%0ALe%20fix%20est%20connu.%20Le%20pattern%20est%20dans%20
 tous%20les%20handbooks%20Postgres.%20Mais%20rien%20dans%20le%20flux%20de%20
 PR%20review%20standard%20ne%20signalait%20%22cette%20commande%20va%20bloque
 r%20les%20writes%20le%20temps%20d'un%20scan%20complet%20de%20table%22.%20Le
 %20reviewer%20senior%20n'a%20pas%20vu.%20La%20CI%20n'a%20pas%20vu.%20Stagin
 g%20n'a%20pas%20vu%20non%20plus%2C%20parce%20que%20staging%20%C3%A9tait%20p
 etit.%0A%0ADonc%20j'ai%20construit%20le%20linter%20que%20je%20voulais%20%3A
 %20une%20GitHub%20Action%20qui%20lit%20chaque%20PR%20de%20migration%20et%20
 flag%20les%20commandes%20qui%20prennent%20un%20lock%20exclusif%2C%20supprim
 ent%20des%20donn%C3%A9es%2C%20ou%20cassent%20la%20version%20d%C3%A9ploy%C3%
 A9e%20pendant%20le%20rollout.%20Quinze%20r%C3%A8gles%2C%20tir%C3%A9es%20de%
 20postmortems%20r%C3%A9els%2C%20Squawk%2C%20ankane%2Fstrong_migrations%2C%2
 0et%20la%20s%C3%A9rie%20Atlas%20PG301-311.%20Multi-ORM%20%E2%80%94%20Prisma
 %2C%20Drizzle%2C%20Rails%2C%20SQL%20brut.%0A%0AC'est%20une%20GitHub%20Actio
 n%20gratuite.%20La%20d%C3%A9tection%20est%20d%C3%A9terministe%2C%20pas%20LL
 M%20%E2%80%94%20un%20outil%20qui%20gate%20les%20merges%20et%20crie%20au%20l
 oup%20se%20fait%20d%C3%A9sactiver%20en%20une%20semaine.%0A%0A%E2%86%92%20mi
 gration.useautopilot.dev%0A%0ASi%20t'as%20d%C3%A9j%C3%A0%20shipp%C3%A9%20un
 e%20migration%20qui%20a%20fait%20tomber%20la%20prod%2C%20c'%C3%A9tait%20quo
 i%20le%20pattern%20%3F%0A%0A%23postgres%20%23devops%20%23buildinpublic\n\n━
