SUMMARY:🚦 [LAUNCH T-15] migration-autopilot — Prep onglets + café
DESCRIPTION:PREP 15 MIN AVANT GO-LIVE.\n\nOnglets à ouvrir :\n1. https://ne
 ws.ycombinator.com/submit\n2. https://migration.useautopilot.dev\n3. https:
 //github.com/marketplace/actions/migration-autopilot\n4. https://github.com
 /isabellehuecloser-ctrl/migration-autopilot\n5. Dashboard Stripe\n6. Formsp
 ree\n\nPréparer : café/eau\, téléphone silencieux\, bloquer Slack.\n\nTITLE
  à coller :\n« Show HN: Migration Autopilot – review every DB-migration PR 
 for safety »\n\nURL à coller :\nhttps://migration.useautopilot.dev\n\nFIRST
  COMMENT à coller IMMEDIATEMENT après submit :\n« Hi HN — solo dev here. I 
 built this because I keep seeing the same migration footguns take down prod
 : SET NOT NULL on a big table\, CREATE INDEX without CONCURRENTLY\, droppin
 g a column the deployed app still reads. The Action runs 15 deterministic r
 ules on every PR. No API key\, no LLM in the detection path — false positiv
 es on a merge-gating tool kill trust within a week. The rule corpus is deri
 ved from Squawk\, ankane/strong_migrations\, the Atlas PG301-311 series\, a
 nd real postmortems. What I'd love feedback on: rules I'm missing\, false p
 ositives on real codebases\, whether the safe-rewrite text is useful or noi
 se. MIT. https://github.com/isabellehuecloser-ctrl/migration-autopilot »
LOCATION:https://news.ycombinator.com/submit
CATEGORIES:MIGRATION-AUTOPILOT-LAUNCH
